# AI Recruitment & Talent Management Copilot

An AI-powered recruitment platform that automates resume parsing, candidate management, job matching, and recruitment analytics. The system helps recruiters reduce manual effort by extracting candidate information from resumes and providing an intuitive dashboard for managing recruitment workflows.

---

## Features

### Milestone 1 – Resume Parsing & Candidate Management
- Upload resumes in PDF and DOCX formats
- Automatically extract candidate details
- Extract:
  - Name
  - Email
  - Phone Number
  - Skills
  - Education
  - Experience
  - Certifications
  - Projects
  - LinkedIn
  - GitHub
- Store extracted information in MySQL
- View all uploaded candidates
- Search candidates
- Delete candidates

### Milestone 2 – Dashboard & Analytics
- Dashboard statistics
- Total candidates
- Total uploads
- Average experience
- Total skills extracted
- Top Skills Analysis
- Education Distribution
- Experience Distribution
- Interactive charts using Chart.js

